<title>UK: Australian/N.Z. wool prices for November.</title>
<headline>Australian/N.Z. wool prices for November.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for November as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 405	  64s 328	  60s 276	  58s 261</p>
<p>   56s 248	  50s 229	  48s 220	  46s 216</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
